"org/'> Lua</a>, <a href='http://maxima.sourceforge.net/'>Maxima</a>, <a "
"href='https://gnu.org/software/octave/'>Octave</a>, <a href='http://python."
"org/'>Python 2 and 3</a>, <a href='http://qalculate.sourceforge."
"net/'>Qalculate</a>, <a href='http://r-project.org/'>R</a>, <a href='http://"
"sagemath.org/'>Sage</a>, and <a href='http://scilab.org/'>Scilab</a>;"
msgstr ""
"Actualmente hai 11 infraestruturas dispoñíbeis: <a href='http://julialang."
"org/'>Julia</a>, <a href='http://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/'>KAlgebra</a>, <a "
"href='http://lua.org/'> Lua</a>, <a href='http://maxima.sourceforge."
"net/'>Maxima</a>, <a href='https://gnu.org/software/octave/'>Octave</a>, <a "
"href='http://python.org/'>Python 2 e 3</a>, <a href='http://qalculate."
"sourceforge.net/'>Qalculate</a>, <a href='http://r-project.org/'>R</a>, <a "
"href='http://sagemath.org/'>Sage</a> e <a href='http://scilab.org/'>Scilab</"
"a>;"

